<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">Hebrewte</book>
  <para style="h">Hebrewte</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hebrewte</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hebrewte</para>
  <para style="mt">Hebrewte</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A bosa hunin, Pathian in ih taanghpupite tungah kamsaangte tungtawnin, lam tuatuam taw tamvei ma paupui hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ahihang hi hun khakbel hunte ah, a Tapa tungtawnin hong paupui hi. Ama tungtawnin Pathian in vaannuai bup bitphua a, a khakbel ciangin na theampo ama ii neisa suak tu in ama sia Pathian ii tealsa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in Pathian' minthanna ii vaangtaang hong lengsak a, ama sia Pathian ii hina zia bang tatak ma hi in, vaannuai bup ama ii a vaang nei a kammal taw khosak hi. Mihingte ii mawnate atu in mawmaitsakna a nga sak zawkciangin Vaanglianpipa Pathian ii ziatsang vantung ah to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ama tungah Pathian piak min sia vantunglalangte min sangin lianzaw ahi bangma in, Tapa sia vantunglalangte sangin lian zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Pathian in vantunglalangte khat po tungah, “Nang sia ka Tapa na hi hi; tu ni in kei sia na Pa ka hi hi,” a ci ngei bua hi. Tuasia bangma in Pathian in, vantunglalangte khat po tungah, “Kei sia ama ii Pa ka hi tu a, ama sia ka Tapa hi tu hi,” ci ngeingawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahihang Pathian in a Tapaciil leitung ah a paisak tu ciangin, “Pathian ii vantunglalangte theampo in ama bia tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ahihang Pathian in vantunglalangte huvau ahile, “Pathian in a vantunglalangte vui suaksak a, a naseamte sia meikuang suaksak hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tapa huvau ahile Pathian in: “Pathian awng, na ngam sia a tawntung a tawntungin kip tu hi! Nangma in na mihingte thutang taw na uk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A maan thute na dei a, a maan ngawl thute na ngaimaw hi. Tua hu in Pathian, na Pathian in nang hong teal zo hi. Tuaciang na lawmte a piak sangin nang tungah lungdamna le upatna a lianzaw hong pia hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ama in a ci laina panin, “Topa awng, nangma in a kipatciilin simlei na bitphua hi, tuaciang na khut mama taw vantungte na vawt hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tuate mangthang tu a, ahihang nang na kip tu hi; Tuate in puan bang lui in sia tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate laktong puasilh bangin na thep tu a, puan bangin na laih tu hi. Ahihang nang na hile a tawntungin na kibang a, na nuntakna a bo ngei bua hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian in a vantunglalangte khat po ii tungah: “Na ngalte na peang nuai ah sisanhin kong neisak mateng, ka ziatsang ah to in,” ci ngeingawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahile vantunglalangte sia bang ziam? Amate sia Pathian naseam thaa te hi a, ngupna a saang tute a hu tu in, a sawlte ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua hu in ei in thumaan thu ih zaak te pan, lam ih pial ngawl natu in ih kholet seseam kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vantunglalangte in ih taanghpupite tungah a thupiakte maan hi ci in lak hi, tuaciang a zui ngawl a ni ngawl khat pawpo sia ama taw a kiphu in daan thuak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua hi a, hi zata in a lian ngupna thusim buathong leang bangbangin suakta tu hi ziam? Topa ama mama in hi ngupna thangsak masa a, tuaciangin a zate in ei tungah tua thu a maanna hong lak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua kawmkaal ah Pathian in nalamdang laknate, a tumdang tuatuamte vawtna le, Thaa Thiangtho letsong te ama ii a dei bangin a hawmsakna taw in amate tetti panna tungah tetti panna belap thua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian in hong pai tu ci in ih son leitung thak sia, a uk tu in vantunglalangte a koi bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua hi ngawl zaw in Laithiangtho mun khat ah: “Pathian awng, mihingte sia bang hi a; tuaza in banghang thinbot ni ziam? mihing ma hi lel napi a bang tu in thinnuammaw ni ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vantunglalangte sangin a niamzaw in tawmvei sung na koi a; upatna le minthanna ama na khusak hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tuaciang na theampo tungah a uk tu in na vawt hi.” Pathian in mihing sia “na theampo a uk tu” in vawt hi, ci hi. Hi thu in na theampo huam siat hi. Ahihang tu laitak hunin, mihing in na theampo uk hi, ci in ih mu bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahihang Pathian ii thuthiamna tungtawnin, mihing theampo atu a thi tu in, vantunglalangte sangin tawmvei hunsung teng a niamzaw in a kivawt Jesus ih mu hi. Thina a thuak hu in tu in minthanna le upatna lukhu a khuk ih mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ta tam mama in ama ii vaangletna a siim thei natu in, na theampo bitphua in a keam Pathian in, Jesus sia a thuakna tungtawnin a cialcing pa a suasak tu sia a maan thu hi takpi hi. Banghang ziam cile amate ngupna sung a then sia Jesus ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama in mihingte sia a mawnate uh panin, thiansua a, tuaciang ama le tuabangin a kithiansua sa theampo in, Pa kibang a nei uh hi. Tua hu in Jesus in, amate sia innkuanpui a nak tu in, a mai a zum bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in Pathian munah, “Ka mite munah na sep sa teng ka son tu hi; amate ii a kikhopna sungah nang kong pok tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in, “Ka muanna sia Pathian tungah ka nga tu hi,” ci hi. Tuaciang, “Hi sungah Pathian ii kei hong piak tanote taw ka om hi,” zongh ci lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama ci bangin tua tanote sia chi le sa taw a om mihingte ahi bangma, Jesus ama mama zongh amate bang hong suak a, amate mihing pianzia teng hong siim hi. Hi bang a hina sia banghang ziam cile ama thina tungtawnin thina tungah vaang a nei doaimangpa a lalcipsak natu hi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />thina a kiitak hu in a nuntak sung teng sila a, a kaai mihingte tuabangin suaktasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile ama ii huna a piakte sia vantunglalangte hi ngawl hi ci in kitelthiang hi. Tua hi ngawl zawin, ama in Abraham ii suan le paalte a hu hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Hisia hu in ama in a suapuite taw na theampo sungah a kiban uh kul hi, banghang ziam cile mihingte a mawna pan mawmaisakna kipiak thei natu in, Pathian na a sepna ah, a thumaan ngual a hesuak thei Thiampi Lianbel a sua natu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tu in ama in ze etna a thuakte sia hu thei hi. Banghang ziam cile ama mama zongh kize et zo a, thuak ngei zo hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian hong sapsa zongh ahi, ka Tapidaw suapuite awng! Ih pualaak upna ii Thiampi Lianbel tu in, Pathian ii a sawlpa Jesus ngaisun vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian ii inn sungah Moses sia a nasepna ah a thumaan bangma in, ama in hi nasep seam tu in a teal Pathian tungah thumaan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Inn khat a sa pa in tua inn sangin upatna nga zaw hi. Tuasia bangma in, Jesus sia Moses sangin vaang piakna lianzaw taw kiphu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Inn theampo a sa khat tek om a, ahizong na theampo a vawt pa sia Pathian ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Moses sia Pathian inn sungah naseampa bangin, thumaan hi. Tuaciangin ama in maisang a Pathian ii son tu thute son hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahihang Christ sia Pathian inn uk Tapa bangin thumaan hi. Eite in, ih lametnate sungah thinletna le kimuanna ih kholet le ama inn ih hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tua ahikom Thaa Thiangtho ii cina taw kizui in, “Tuni in Pathian aw na za uh le,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />na taanghpupite sennealngam sungah a om uh lai, Pathian a langpan lai, Pathian a ze et uh hun lai bangin, na thin uh na sahsak heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate in kum sawmli tawntung ka sep teng mu zo napi Kei hong ze et uh a, hong sin zazaan uh hi, Pathian in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tua ahikom tua mite tungah ka thin uuk a, hi bangin ka ci hi, ‘Amate in kei tungah hong thumaan ngawl tawntung a, ka thupiakte hong nial uh hi.’
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka thin uuk a, ‘Tawlngakna ka piak natu ngam ah amate tum ngeingawl tu hi!’ ci in: a ciliaphuai kamciamna ka vawt hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ka thu uppuite awng, a nungta Pathian kung pan na lampial ngawl natu in, no sungah kuama peuma in ngitlona thinsung le up ngawlna thin na nei ngawl natu in kidawm tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Laithiangtho sungah, “Tuni” a kici kammal sia a kizak thei lai teng mawna ii hong theam ngawl natu le na thin uh a sak ngawl natu in, khat le khat ni simin na kihu zawk uh kul tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile a kipat pan ih nei kimuanna sia a tawp dongin ih kholet le ei theampo sia Christ taw a kikopte ih hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Hisia laithiangtho ii ci ahi hi: “Tuni in Pathian ii aw na za le, na taanghpupite ii Pathian a langpan lai uh bangin na thin uh na sahsak heak vun.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian aw za a, ama a langpante a kuate ziam? Moses ii Egypt ngam panin a pusuapui theampo ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian sia kum sawmli tawntung a kuate ii tungah thin uuk ziam? Sennealngam sungah puk a, a thi mawneite tungah Pathian a thin uuk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathian in a ciliaphuai kamciam pia a, “Amate tawlngakna ka piak natu ngam ah a tum ngei buatu uh hi,” a ci sia — akua te ii thu a sonna ziam? Ama a langpante ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Amate in tua ngam sungah tum thei ngawl hi, banghang ziam cile amate in um ngawl ahihang hi ci in ih he hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tu in Pathian in, ama sonsa tawlngak nuam sia ih nga thei natu in kamciam hong pia hi. Tua ahiciang, tua tawlngak nuam sia saang ngawlin khat zongh ih om thaak ngawl natu eite kidawm tek tawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile eite zongh amate bangma in lungdamna thu ih za zo hi. Amate ahile tua thu za napi amate atu phatuamna a pia bua hi. Banghang ziam cile amate in a zaak uh ciangin upna taw a saang bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Tua hi a, ei a umte in, Pathian hong kamciamsa tawlngak nuam sia ih saang hi. “Ka thin uuk a, hi bangin a ciliap huai kamciam ka vawt hi. ‘Amate in ka piak tu tawlngakna ngamnuam ah a tum ngei buatu hi!’ ” a ci bang tatak ma ahi hi. Ama ii nasep sia simlei a bitphua hun panin a kiman sa hi napi tu a bangin ci veve hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Laithiangtho sung mun khat ah ni sali ni huvau hi bangin ci hi: “Pathian sia a nasepna theampo pan a ni sali ni in tawlnga hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hi thu a kison kik leleau na ah, “Amate in tawlngakna ka piak natu ngam ah a tum ngei buatu hi.” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lungdamna Thu a za phit te in tua tawlngak nuam sia a saang bua uh hi. Banghang ziam cile amate in a um bua uh hi. Tua ahikom a saang tu in, a deisak midang om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Hi thu sia koi bangin kilak ziam cile Pathian in, “Tuni,” a kici nidang khat koi hi. Tua zawk kum tam mama ciangin, a kisonsa laithiangtho khante sungah a om bangma in Pathian in David tungtawnin, tua thute hi bangin son hi: “Tuni in Pathian aw na za uh le, na thin na sahsak heak vun.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Joshua in Pathian kamciam ahi tawlngak nuam sia mihingte tungah pia zo hi thong le, Pathian in nidang khat ciang son kik nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua ahikom ni sali ni in Pathian a tawlngak bangma in, Pathian mite atu in tawlngak nuam khat om lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile tua Pathian kamciam a piak tawlngak nuam sungah a tawlnga peuma in, Pathian tawlngak bangma in, amate nasepna pan a tawlnga tu uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tua ahikom, amate upna a sel hu in tawlngakna a nga ngawl bang ih sua ngawl natu in, ei zongh tua tawlngakna sia ih saan thei natu in, ih hi theiza in hanciam tawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathian kammal in nungta a, thahat in, lang nii hiam namsau sangin hiam zaw hi. Ama in thaa le thinsung kisiktuana mun, ngu le taang ngungeak kipeena mun teng pailet hi. Ama in mihing deina le lungngulna te tungah thukhen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian mai ah bangma a kiseal thei bua hi; bitphua sa na theampo sia ama mai ah kipualaak siat hi. Tuaciangin ih sep ih vawt sa theampo tungah thu hong sit tu sia ama ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahikom ih upna ih pualaak sate ii tungtaang ah eite kip tek tawng. Banghang ziam cile eite in Pathian omna tatak ah a pai sa, Thiampi Lianbelpa — Pathian Tapa Jesus ih nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ih Thiampi Lianbelpa in ei tha zawmna hong khuangai pui thei ngawlpa ahi bua hi. Tuabang hi ngawl zaw in, Thiampi Lianbelpa in, eima bangma in ze etna namcin na thuak a, ahizong a khial ngei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tua ahikom, kimuanna nei in thuthiamna a omna mun Pathian kumpi tokhum kung zuan tek tawng. Tua munah hesuakna ih saang tu a, ih kitaangsap laitak hong hu tu in, thuthiamna ih mu tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thiampi lianbel peuma a mipuite sung panin kiteal a, mawmai natu sangaw biakpiakna le piakkhiatna vawt tu in, amate taangin Pathian naseam tu a kitavaw te ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama mama in thaneamna tuatuam nei ahikom, thu tel ngawlte le khialna vawtte tungah ama in, cingh thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama mama thaneam ahikom, a mihingte mawna atu bek hi ngawlin ama mawnate atu zongh sangaw biakpiakna a sep kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thiampi lianbelpa za sia ama le ama kiteal a, a kipia kuama om ngeingawl hi. Aaron tungah a kipiak bangin — mihing khat sia Pathian ii samna bek taw thiampi lianbel kisuaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuasia bangma in Christ in ama le ama thiampi lianbel za a kipia bua hi. Pathian in ama munah, hi bangin ci zaw hi, “Nang sia ka Tapa na hi hi; tuni in Kei sia nangma ii Pa ka suak hi.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mundang khat ah a sonna panin, “Nangma sia thiampi na hi tawntung tu hi. Melchizedek taw a kinguizui thiampi na hi tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Leitung ah a nuntak lai in Jesus in thina pan a ngum thei, Pathian tungah a nging auna le thitui luanna taw thungetna le dei ngetnate nei hi. Ama kiniam khiak a, Pathian ii deina a zuipa ahi hu in, Pathian in za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in Pathian Tapa ahihang, thuakna tungtawnin thunitna sin hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama sia a cingtaak a kisuasak zawkciang, ama thu a ni theampo atu in, tawntung ngupna ii naak a suak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian in ama sia Melchizedek pan a kinguizui susuk thiampi lianbel in saang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Hi thu tungtaang son tu tam mama om hi. Ahihang no tungah son tel thei tu haksa hi. Banghang ziam cile note in thu na tel hak mama uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Note in sya na sep natu uh, hun tam ma om zo napi — Pathian thu kipatciilna taw hong hil tu khat na kisamh lai uh hi. Antak ne tu hi zo napi noai na neak uh kul lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Noai ne khat pawpo sia patang hi lai a, a maan le a maan ngawl a khentel thei ngawl laite na hi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Antak sia ulian sate atu hi a, amate in, kisinna tungtawnin a pha le a sia khentel thei uh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tua ahikom Tapidawte tungah thuhil phitnate nungsangah nusia in, a puicing kihilna taw eite mainawt tawng! A mannung ngawl nasepnate nusia in Pathian ih upna,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />baptize na nanamte, khut ngakna. tawntung thukhenna le a thisate thawkiknate, kansuut kikik pheang nawn bua tawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Eite mainawt tawng! Pathian in hong lungkimpui le, ih vawt tu sia hisia ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile a upna uh a nusia sate sia a kisii kik natu in, kikaizawn kik thei nawn na ziam? Amate sia khatvei lai in Pathian ii khuavak sungah om ngei zo uh hi. Amate sia vantung letsong tep ngei zo uh hi. Amate sia Thaa Thiangtho zongh a saang ngeisa ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian kammal pha hi ci in a tel sa, maisang a hong pai pheang tu, hun ii vaangletna zongh a he sate ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua zawkciang amate in a upna uh taisan uh hi! Amate sia a kisii kik tu sia suak thei nawn ngawl hi. Banghang ziam cile, amate in Pathian Tapa sia Thinglamtee tungah kilh kik a, mipi mai ah a maizumhuai in a pholaak ahi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lothote atu a limci ankungte a posak nguatui a dawn leitangte ii tungah Pathian in thupha pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahihang lopa le lingkungte a posak a ahile, tua leitang sia a mannung bua hi. Pathian ii haamsiat tu le, meikuang taw a halcip tu lauhuai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ahizong hi bangin ih pau hang, kong it lawmte awng, no atu sia ka lungmuang hi. Note ii ngupna taw kizui thupha a phazawte na nei uh sia kong he uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian sia a maan ngawlin a ngamta ngei bua hi. Ama in na a sepnate ahizong, ama ii tungah itna na lakna uh ahi, Tapidawpui te ii tungah huna na piakte le na piapiak laite sia hong makngilsak ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Deisakna lianpi kong neisakna uh sia, bang ziam cile, na lamet uh thute hong taangtung takpi thei natu in, na lawpna uhte a tawp dongin, mihing sim in, na kepcing tek tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Na datham tu sia kong deisak bua uh hi, Pathian ii kamciamte na nga natu in, a umte le a thinsaute bang na hi natu in kong deisak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian in Abraham tungah kamciam a piak ciangin, a kamciam teng a taangtun natu ama in kiciamna vawt hi. Ama sangin a lianzaw om nawn ngawl ahikom, ama ii min taw kiciam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in “Thupha kong pia tu a, suan le paal tam mama kong pia tu hi ci in kamciam kong pia hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Abraham sia a thinsau ahikom Pathian ii kamciam teng a saang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mihing khat in kiciamna a vawt ciangin, ama sangin a lianzaw khat ii min zangh a, tua in kinialna theampo bosak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama ii kamciam a piakte, a saang tute tungah, Pathian in a tup a sawmna peal ngeingawl hi, ci in thiang takin telsak nuam ahikom a kamciamte sia, kiciamna taw in belap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua hi a, thu nam nii om hi, tuate sia kikheal thei ngawl a, Pathian in tua thute taw kisai in leilot thei ngawl hi. Tua ahikom ama sungah ngammuanna a ngate in, ih mai ah hong kikoi lametna sia kho takin ih let natu in nasia takin hanna ih nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hi lametna sia ih nuntakna atu in, thikkip bangin, ih nei hi. Tuasia in, maanin, muanhuai a, vantung biakinn a kidalna puankhai sia kaantanin mun thiangtho sungnung ah pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ei taangin, Jesus in eite mai tua munah paikhol zo hi. Tuaciang, Melchizedek thiampi sia taw a kinguizui, a tawntung atu in, thiampi lianbel hong suak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hi Melchizedek sia Salem kumpipa hi a, a Saangbel Pathian ii thiampipa ahi hi. Abraham sia kumpi li taw kisimin, ngalzo a hong cia ciang, Melchizedek taw kisi a Melchizedek in thupha pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuaciang Abraham in ngalte ii neisa a laak theampo tung pan see sawm sua see khat ama pia hi. (Melchizedek min ii khiakna masa sia “Thutang Kumpipa,” cina hi a, tuaciang, Salem kumpipa zongh kici ahikom, “Kilemna Kumpipa,” zongh kici si hi.)
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Melchizedek ii pa ahizong a nu ahizong a taanghpupite min ahizong a kiciamtee mun om ngawl hi. A suana ahizong a thina ahizong tepteena om ngawl hi. Ama sia Pathian Tapa bang ahi hi. Ama in a tawntungin thiampi hi top hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ahikom ama bangza in lian ziam ci in na ngaisun thei uh hi. A minthang ih taanghpupi ahi Abraham zongh in, ngal kisim na phual pan a, a nga vanhte sung pan see sawm sua see khat ama pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuaciang, Levi suan thiampite sia Thukham in Israel mite tung pan see sawm sua see khat, a laak natu thupia hi. Tuate in, a minampuite hi a, tua a minampuite sia Abraham suante ma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Melchizedek sia Levi suan hi ngawl hi. Ahihang Abraham tung panin see sawm sua see khat la in, Pathian kamciam a saang Abraham sia thupha pia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thupha a pia pa in, thupha a saang sia sangin, lianzaw ahi hunlam tel laak om ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thiampite tungtaang a, see sawm sua see khat sia, a thithei mihingte in la hi. Ahihang Melchizedek ahile, laithiangtho son bangma in, see sawm sua see khat sia a nungta pa in la hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Bang ci nuam hi ziam cile, Abraham in see sawm sua see khat a piak ciangin Levi in zongh a pia suak hi (A suan a paalte in khon hi).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A tatakin ci leang, Levi sia piang ngawl lai hi, Melchizedek in, Abraham taw a kimu lai in Levi sia a taanghpupi Abraham pumpi sungah om hi, ci tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Levi thiampite bulphu in, Israel mite tungah Thukham a kipia ahi hi. Tu in Levi thiampite nasepna sia a cialcing sa hile thiampi nam dang khat a pian kul ngawl tu hi. Tua Thiampi in Aaron za laih hi ngawlin, Melchizedek za laih tu a kulna sia hi thu hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile thiampi huvau ah kikhealna a om ciang, thukham zongh a kikheal kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tu a ih son teng huvau sia ih Topa in phung dang pan hi a, ama bee le phung sung pan thiampi a seam ngei kuama a om bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama sia Judah minam a piang ahi hunlam sia a kuama po ii heak ahi hi. Tuaciang thiampite huvau a son ciangin Moses in Judah min a lo ngei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A thu paizia sia thiang vaial hi; thiampi tuam dangkhat hong khang a, tua pa sia Melchizedek bangma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama sia thiampi kisuaksak hi. Mihingte ngeina le zui tu thu omte taw hi ngawlin mong nei ngawl nuntakna khat ii vaang taw kisuaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile laithiangtho in, “Nang sia thiampi khat na hi tawntung tu hi. Melchizedek taw a kinguizui thiampi za lua pa na hi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ahikom ngeina lui sia, kiheam hi. Banghang ziam cile tua in thaneam a, a mannung bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Moses thukham in bangma a cialcingsak thei bua hi. Tu in Pathian taw ih kinai thei natu lametna phazaw khat hong kipia zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaban ah, Pathian kiciamna zongh om si hi. Midangte thiampi a kisuasak lai in, tuabang kiciamna a om bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ahihang Jesus sia kiciamna khat taw thiampi a sua natu Pathian in, “Topa in a ciliap huai kamciamna khat vawt zo a, tuaciang, ama in a dawk kik buatu hi. ‘Nang sia a tawntungin thiampi na hi tu hi’ ” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ahikom hi a kilamdanna in, Jesus sia a phazaw thuciamna a kipsak pa zongh suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A kilamdanna dang khat zongh om lai hi: thiampi dang tam mama a om hi, banghang ziam cile amate sia thithi a, a nasep uh a zomto thei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ahihang Jesus sia nungta tawntung ahikom ama ii thiampi nasep sia ngualdang a ki aap sawn bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ahikom ama in, tu le a tawntungin, ama tungtawn a, Pathian kung a zuante sia hun thei hi, banghang ziam cile ama in amate atu Pathian munah thu ngetsak tu in, a nungta tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Tua ahikom Jesus sia ih kitaangsapnate hong kicingsak thei, Thiampi Lianbel ahi hi. Ama thiangtho a; ama in mawna ahizong, khialna ahizong, ama sungah a nei bua hi; ama sia mawneite sung panin, kidoi tuam a, vantungte sangin a saang zaw in kilaamto hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama sia thiampi lianbel dangte taw a kibang bua hi; a masa phitbelin, ama mawna atu le tua zawkciang midangte mawna atu in, sangaw biakna ni simin a piak kul ngawl hi. Ama le ama a kipiak ciangin, a tawntung atu in khatvei lian sangaw biakpiakna vawt zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Moses Thukham in a cialcing ngawl mihingte thiampi lianbel tu in sep hi; ahihang Thukham om zawkciang hong piang, Pathian ii kiciamna taw a vawt kamciam in a tawntung atu in a cialcing Tapa sia Thiampi suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ih sawson theampo ii bulpi in, tuabangin eite ii Thiampi Lianbel khat ih neina thu ahi hi. Tua pa in vantung ah Vaanglian Pathian tokhum ziatsang ah to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ama in mihingte ii sak ahi ngawl, Topa ii sak buk tatak ahi A Thiangthobel Mun ah Thiampi Lianbel seam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thiampi Lianbel theampo sia Pathian tungah piakkhiatnate le nganhing taw biakpiaknate a pia tu in, a kisep ahi hi. Tua ahi bangma, ih Thiampi Lianbelpa zongh in, na khat peuma a piak nanak tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Jew te Thukham deina bangin letsong a pia tu in thiampite om ahi nungsang, hi leitung ah ama hong om le zong thiampi hi ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A tatakin ci leang ama ii a thiampi nasep in vantung a sia a zui hi a, tua ii limh bek ahi hi. Tua in Moses ii sepna sia bangma ahi hi. Ama in Puanbuk Thiangtho a sak tu ciangin, Pathian in, “Mualtung ah hong kilak sia ii lim bang tatakin, na theampo na vawt hamtang in,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ahihang tu in, Jesus a ki aap thiampi nasepna sia amate aa sangin lianzaw a, Pathian le a mihingte kilaklaw ah a vawt thuciamna sia zongh amate aa sangin, a phat zawk bangma ahi hi. Banghang ziam cile tua thuciamna sia a phazaw nate kamciam piaknate tungah kidoppha ahi hu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A masa thuciamna sia ah khialna om ngawl hi thong le, a niina thuciamna sia kul ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ahihang Pathian in, a mite tungah khialna mu ahikom thu a sonna ah, “Topa in, Israel mite le Judah mite taw thuciamna thak khat, ka vawt tu hun hong theng tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate ii taanghpupite taw thuciamna ka vawt bang ahi buatu hi. A khut uh pan kai in, Egypt pan ka pusuapui hunlai bang ahi buatu hi. Amate taw ka vawt thuciamnate tungah a thumaan bua uh hi, tua ahikom amate ka awlmawk bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tu in hisia in, maisang hong pai lai tu hun sungah, Israel mite taw ka vawt tu thuciamna ahi hi, Topa in ci hi: Ka thukhamte amate thinsung ah ka koi tu a, a lungtang tungah ka at tu hi. Kei sia amate ii Pathian ka hi tu a, amate sia keima ii mite ahi tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate kuama in a minam puite a hil sawn a kul nawn buatu hi. ‘Topa he vun,’ zongh amate tetek tungah a kici buatu hi. Banghang ziam cile amate in kei hong he siat tu a, a nobel panin a lianbel dongin hong he tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A mawnate uh ka maisak tu a, a khialnate uh ka ciamtee nawn buatu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian in thuciamna thak sia a son ciangin, a masa sia a lui suaksak hi; tuaciangin bang khat pawpo a lui a tul sate sia hai ngawlin bomang tu hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Thuciam masa sia in biakpiakna ngeinate le mihing ii vawt biakna mun zongh nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Puanbuk khat kisa a, a puanung sia Thiangtho Mun kici hi. Tua ii sungah mei detna khuam le Pathian a piak anluum koina sabuai om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kidalna puankhak a niina sia ii nungsangah Thiangthobel Mun a kici puanbuk khat om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tua ii sungah sathau namtui halna, khamh biaknatau le, khamh taw a kituam Thuciamna Thingkuang om a, a sungah manna koina khamh uum le a teeno a suak Aaron ciangkhut le thupiakte a ki atna suangpheak niite om uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuate tungah Pathian ompuina lim a lak, cherub te om a, maw kimaisakna mun ii tung pan a tha taw siin uh hi. Ahihang tu laitak sia tua nate theampo a vaikhua in son tu hun ahi bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hite sepzia sia hi bang ahi hi. Thiampite in ni simin puanbuk puanung sungah tumin a sep tute seam uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />ahihang a sungnung doituam sungah, Thiampi Lianbelpa bek kum khatin khatvei tum hi. Ama ii mawna le a mihingte ii a phaw thaak ngawl mawnate atu in, chisan la in, Pathian bia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Puanbuk puanung sia a kip in a om laitengin Thiangthobel Mun kihong ngawl lai hi, ci in Thaa Thiangtho in thiang takin hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hisia in tu hun kilakna lim khat ahi hi. Pathian tungah a kipia biakpiakna le, nganno taw biakpiakna in, a biate thinsung cialcingsak thei ngawl hi ci thu kimu hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />banghang ziam cile tuate in anneak, tuidawn le kithiansuana tuatuamte taw kisai bek hi. Hite sia a puatham zui tu ngeinate hi a, Pathian ngeina thak a piak sia a kipsak mateng atu hi bek hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ahihang Christ sia hi lai ah a omsa naphate theampo ii Thiampi Lianbel tu in hong pai zo hi. Ama ii thiampi sepna puanbuk sia lianzaw a, cialcing zaw hi; tuasia in mihingte ii vawt hi ngawl a, a kibitphua simlei taw a kisai ahi bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Christ in Thiangthobel Mun ah khatvei lian a tum zawkciang, ama in, kealte le khuitalte ii chi sia biakpiakna tu in a keng bua hi. Ama chisan piazaw in, ei atu in tawntung ngupna hong ngasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kealte le khuitalte ii chi le khuino halna vaamte a kithe ciang biakna huvau a, a thiangtho ngawl mihingte thiangthosak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hisia thumaan ahikom, Christ ii chisan in bangza in seam zozaw seseam tu ziam! Tawntung Thaa tungtawnin, ama in Pathian tungah ama le ama a cialcing sangaw biakpiakna in, kipia zo hi. Ama chisan in a mannung ngawl biakna huvau panin, ih thinsung hong thiangsak tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tawntung thupha Pathian kamciamte a saan thei natu in, Pathian sapsa mihingte atu, Christ in thuciam thak khat hong vawtsakna in, hisia hang ahi hi. Hisia kipiangsak thei hi, banghang ziam cile thina khat om a thuciam masa sia a om kimlai ma in, mihingte a khialnate pan tua thina in suaktasak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ngamhlua natu lai a kinusiat tungtaang ah tua lai atpa sia thi zo ci in a lak thei tu kisamh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />banghang ziam cile thi zawkciang atu in a ki at lai sia, a at pa nuntak lai teng kizangh thei ngawl a, a at pa thi zawkciang bekin kizangh thei pheang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua hi a, thuciam masa sia ngawngawn zongh chisan zakna bek taw thu suak thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A masa phitbel in Thukham sungah a thupiak theampo mihingte tungah Moses in sonthiang phot hi. Tua zawkciangin khuitalte le kealte chi la in tui taw a hel zawkciang, hyssop baak le tuu mulsan pawlkhat zanghin, Thukham laibu tung le mihingte tungah the hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in “Hi chi in Pathian ii ih zui tu a, hong thupiak thuciamna a kipsak sia ahi hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuasia bangma Moses in Puanbuk Thiangtho tung le biakna ah a kizangh nate theampo tungah chi the hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A tatakin, thukham ii ci bang hile na theampo phialma chisan in thiansua a, chisan a buak ciang bekin mawmaisakna om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Vantung ah a om nate ii lim a late sia tuabangin kithiansua hi. Ahihang vantung nate mama in a phazaw biakpiaknate kulsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile, Christ in a tatak sia ii lim ahi mihingte vawt Thiangtho Mun sungah a tum bua hi. Ama in vantung tatak ma ah tumin Pathian mai ah eite luangin, tu in a na kilak tawntung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Jew te Thiampi Lianbelpa in Thiangthobel Mun ah kum simin nganno chi taw tum hi. Ahihang Christ in ama le ama a kipia kikik bua hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />tuabang hi thong le, simlei a kibitphua pan kipan tamveipi na thuak zo tu hi. Tu in hunkhen theampo a tawp natu hong nai ciangin, ama le ama a kipiakna taw mawna kithiansua natu in, ama in a tawntung atu, khatvei lian hong kilaak zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mihing theampo khatvei tek thi tu a, tua zawkciang Pathian in amate tungah thukhen tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tuasia bangma in, Christ zongh mihing tampite mawna a laaksak tu in, a nuntakna khatvei lian a kipia ahi hi. Ama sia a nii veina hong kilangh tu a, mawna taw kipekan tu hi nawn ngawlin, ama ngak nginge in a omte hun tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jew te Thukham sia a tatakte ii a kicing le a maan lim ahi zo bua hi; hong pai tu naphate ii a kician tak ngawl a pianzia bek ahi hi. Tua sangaw biakpiaknate zongh kum simin kipia tawntung hi. Tua ahile hi sangaw biakpiaknate tungtawnin, Thukham sia in Pathian kung a zuan mihingte bangbang hong cialcingsak thei tu ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pathian a bia mihingte sia a mawna panin, kithiansua takpi hi le amate sia mawna taw kithasung nawn ngawl tu a, sangaw biakpiakna theampo om nawn ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ahihang kum khat zawkciang kum khat sangaw biakpiaknate in, mihingte mawna phawksak kik tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile khuitalte le kealtalte chi in mawnate a la keak thei ngei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hi thu hangin Christ sia leitung ah hong pai tu ciangin ama in Pathian tungah, “Sangaw biakpiaknate le piakkhiatna te na dei bua hi, ahihang kei atu in pumpi khat nong koisak khol zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Nang in mawmaisak natu in biaknatau tungah nganhing a kipumhalte ahibuale sangaw biakpiaknate taw na lung a kim bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuaciangin, ‘Thukham laibu sungah keima thu a ki at bangma in, Pathian awng, na deina bang a seam tu in, Hi sungah om ing,’ ka ci hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in a masa in, “Nang in sangaw biakpiakna, piaknate le mawnate laakkeak natu in, biaknatau tungah nganhing pumhalte na dei bua a, na lung a kim bua hi,” ci hi. Tua ahikom Pathian in sangaw biakpiaknate Thukham bangin kipia hi napi, tu a bangin na ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua zawkciangin, ama in, “Pathian awng, na deina bang a seam tu in, hi sungah om khi hi,” ci hi. Tua ahikom Pathian in sangaw biakpiakna lui te phiat siat a, Christ ii kipumpiak biakpiakna taw theak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian dei bangin Christ in ngamta ahikom, ama ii tawntung atu khatvei lian a pumpi a kipiakna hu in eite theampo mawna pan hong kithiansua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jew thiampite khat simin, a nasep sia ni simin seam a, sangaw biakpiakna sia tamvei ma pia veve hi; Ahihang hi sangaw biakpiaknate in mawnate a la keak thei ngei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ahihang Christ in mawnate atu in, sangaw biakpiakna khat pia a, tua biakpiakna sia a tawntung atu in, kikhomsuan hi, tua zawkciangin, ama sia Pathian ii ziatsang ah to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A ngalte sia peang ngakna tokhum bangin ama ii peang nuai ah Pathian ii a koi mateng, tu in ama in tua munah ngak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tua ahiciang ama in khatvei a kipumpiakna taw mawna pan a kithiansuate, a tawntung atu in a cialcing suaksak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tuaciangin Thaa Thiangtho zongh in, ama ii tetti panna hong pia hi. Hi bangin ci masa hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Hisia maisang ah hong pai tu hun sungah amate taw ka vawt tu thuciamna hi. Ka thukhamte amate lungtang sungah ka koi tu a, a thinsung ah ka at tu hi,” Topa in ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuaciangin ama in, “Amate mawnate le ngitlo ngamtatnate ka ciamtee nawn buatu hi” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua ahikom hi mawnate hong kimaisak zawkciangin, mawnate laak keak natu piakkhiatna dang a kul nawn bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tuaciangin suapuite awng, Jesus ii chisan hu in, Thiangthobel Mun ah ih tum natu in, suatakna a kicing takin ih nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in eite atu ama ii pumpi ahi kidalna puankhak sia pailetin — a nungta lampi thak khat hong honsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Eite in Pathian ii innpi a uk thiampi lian khat ih nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tua ahikom thintak le upna maan taw mawna kithasunna pan, a kithiansua sa lungtang le tuithiang taw a kisil sa pumpite taw Pathian kung zuan tek tawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ih pualaak sa lametna kholet tawng, banghang ziam cile Pathian in, hong kamciam sate sia kholet tu hi, ci in ih muang ngam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Khat le khat kithinbot tawng, ki itna kilak in a pha ngamtat natu kihu tek tawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pawlkhatte bang hi ngawlin, eite in kikhoptua ngei sia thasua bua tawng. Topa Ni hong nai hi ci in, mu na hi uh ciangin, khat le khat kihanthawn seseam zaw tawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile thumaan hong kiheaksak zawkciang, mawna ih vawt kaltang lai le, mawna maisak natu, biakpiakna khat beak zongh om nawn ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hong pai pheang tu thukhenna le Pathian a langpante a lalcipsak tu a kiitakhuai meikuang sia launa taw ngak a, ih om tu bek taang lai hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Moses thukham a paltan khat pawpo sia tetti nii ahibuale a tamzaw taw thukhenin a kimawsak le hesuakna om ngawlin kithisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Tua ahile Pathian Tapa a zawngsak pa sia bang suak tu ziam? Mawna pan a, a thiansua Pathian thuciamna chisan a awlmaw ngawlte, thuthiamna Thaa a zawngsak te, bang tek suak tu ziam? Ngaisun vun, tuabang mihing khat ii thuak tu a kilawm daan sia bangza in nasia zaw tu ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile, “Phu ka lam tu a, ka thuk kik tu hi,” a ci sia pa le, “Topa in ama mihingte thu a khen tu hi,” a ci sia pa zongh ih he hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A nungta Pathian khut sung ih taaksuk tu sia lauhuai mama hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />A bosa hun sungah note, bangbang hi kana nu ziam, phawk kik vun. Tualai in, Pathian khuavak sia no tungah hong taan zawkciang, na tam mama na thuak ngei uh hi. Ahitazong kisaan in na hanciamna ah, na lel bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Note khat vevei ngual sungah a kilanghin hong kivawtsia a, tuaciang hun dangte ah hi bangin a kivawtsiate na pawlpui ngam uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Thongtaakte na thuakpui uh a, na neisa theampo hong kimatsak ciangin, tua supna sia lungdam takin na thuak uh hi, banghang ziam cile a tawntung a, a kikhomsuan tu, a phazaw pek khat, nei nginge lai na hi uh sia na he uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Tua ahiciang na thinletna uh thasua heak vun. Banghang ziam cile tuasia in thaman lian mama taw hong kizom tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Pathian ii deina bangin na sep thei natu le, ama hong kamciamte na saan thei natu in, na thin na sausak kul tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile laithiangtho in, “Tawmvei zawkciang, hong pai tu pa hong pai tu hi; ama haisaang ngawl tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Bangpo ahizong a thutang ka mite in, um tu a nungta tu hi: ahihang amate khat po a heak kik le ama ii tungah ka lungkim ngawl tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Eite in heak kik a, a mangthangte ih hi bua hi. Ei sia upna nei in a kingumte ih hizaw hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Upna nei ih ci sia, lametna ih neinate tungah thinmuanna hi a, a kimu thei ngawl laite tungtaang ah muan ngamna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Taanghlai mihingte sia upna a nei hu in, Pathian lungkim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vaannuai bup sia Pathian kammal taw kibitphua a, a kimu thei nate sia a kimu thei ngawl nate panin, kivawt hi ci in upna taw ih tel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Upna taw Abel ii Pathian tungah a biakpiakna sia Cain ii biakpiakna sangin phazaw hi. Ama ii upna tungtawnin, ama sia Pathian in thutang hi ci in a saan pa hi a, banghang ziam cile Pathian mama in a piakte lungkim hi. Abel sia thi zo ahihang ama ii upna in thu hong son lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Upna in Enoch sia thina panin keam hi. A thi tu luangin, Pathian in ama la to zaw a, kuama in ama mu thei nawn ngawl hi. Laithiangtho sungah Enoch sia a kilaak to ma in, Pathian lungdamsak hi, ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Upna ngawl taw kuama in, Pathian lungdamsak thei ngawl hi, banghang ziam cile Pathian kung a zuan peuma in, ama sia om takpi a, ama a zongte thaman pia hi, ci in, a up uh kul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama ii a mu thei ngawl maisang ah hong tung pheang tu nate huvau, Pathian ii kingintaak natu a sonte, Noah ii a zaak thei sia upna hang ahi hi. Ama in Pathian thu ni a, teambaw vawtin, tua ii sungah ama le a innkuanpuite kisuatak hi. Tua hu in leitung bup sia puavawkna thuak a, tuaciang upna pan hong pai thutang suana sia Noah in Pathian tung panin nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pathian ii kamciam a piaksa ngam ah a pai tu in, Abraham in Pathian ii sapna a nit sia upna hang ahi hi. Ama in koisung pai tu ci in he ngawl pipi ma in, a ngam nusia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pathian ii ama tungah, a kamciamsa ngam ah ngamdangmi khat in a teen sia upna hang ahi hi. Ama in Pathian tung pan a kibang kamciamna ma a saang, Isaac le Jacob bangma in puanbuk sungah teang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Abraham in Pathian ii ngealin a sak, a bulkip khuapi ngak nginge hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Abraham huai mama zo a, a zi Sarah zongh ta nei thei ngawl hi napi upna in ama sia pa khat suaksak hi. Pathian in a kamciam sia tungsak tu hi, ci in muang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Abraham sia a thithi ma hi zo napi, hi pasal khat ii a suan le a paal sia van a aksi za le tuipivaal ah a kisim zo ngawl senvui za ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hi mite theampo sia upna sungah thi uh hi. Amate in Pathian ii kamciamte saang man ngawl a, a khualana pan ngal mu bek uh hi, ahitazong lungkim veve uh hi. Tuaciang amate in hi leitung ah ngamdangmi le ngaltaite bang ahi uh sia pualaak uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tuabang a pualaakte in, amate aituam tu ngam khat zong hi ci in kitelthiangsak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Amate in a nusiat sa ngam sia a ngaisusun nawn bua uh hi, ngaisun nuam le a heak kik natu hunpha om thei tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Amate ii lungngul sia ngam phazaw, vantung ngam hi zaw hi. Tua ahikom Pathian in amate ii Pathian hi a kici sia a mai a zum bua hi. Banghang ziam cile ama in, amate atu khuapi khat vawtkhol sa in koisak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pathian in Abraham a ze et lai in, a tapa Isaac sia sangaw biakpiakna bangin a pia ngamsak sia upna ahi hi. Abraham sia Pathian ii kamciam a piakna pa hi napi ama in a tapa khat bek a nei sia sangaw biakpiakna in nei tu kithoai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Pathian in Abraham tungah, “Isaac tungtawnin kong kamciamsa suan le paalte na nei tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Abraham in Isaac sia thina pan Pathian in thosak kik thei tu hi ci in tuat hi, tua ahiciang Abraham in Isaac sia thina panin nga kik — ci tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Isaac in Jacob le Esau ii maisang atu thupha a piak sia upna hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Jacob in a thi mahiat in, Joseph tapate thupha a piak sia upna hang ahi hi. Ama in a ciangkhut dawnah kinang in Pathian bia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Joseph in a thi dektak ciangin Israel mite Egypt ngam pan a pusua natu thu a son sia le ama luanghawm tungtaang ah a ngamtat natu uh a vaithak teng sia upna hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Moses a sua zawk tha thum sung, a nu le a pa in, ama a sealcip uh sia, upna hang ahi hi. Amate in ama sia nauno hoi khat hi, ci in mu ahikom, kumpipa thupiakna a nit ngawl uh hang, a lau bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Moses hong khanthin tak ciang kumpipa tanu ii a tapa a kici tu uuk ngawlin a nial sia upna hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tawmvei sung mawna sungah a nopsak tu sangin, Pathian ii mihingte taw a thuak khop tu sia uukzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama in Messiah hangin huasaakna a thuak tu sia, Egypt ngam ii hauna theampo sangin, kimanh zaw pek sa hi, banghang ziam cile ama in maisang thaman a saan pheang lai tu te mitsuan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Moses in kumpipa thin uuk tu lau ngawlin, Egypt ngam a nusiat sia upna hang ahi hi. A kimu thei ngawl Pathian sia a mu bang phetin, nungsang ah heak kik tu a uuk bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thina ii Vantunglalang in, Israel mite ii tapaciil theampo a thalup thaak ngawl natu in ama in Paisan Poai piangsak a, kongkhate tungah chisan a kinoi natu thu a piak zongh upna hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Upna in San Tuipi sia leiko tung tot bangin, Israel mite kaantansak zo a, Egypt mite in kaantan tu in a kipat ciang, tuipi in amate valhlum siat hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Israel mite Jericho khua ni sali kiimkotin a pai zawkciang tua khua luphungte a cip thapna in upna hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Pumpi zuak numei Rahab sia Pathian thu a ni ngawlte taw a kithalup khop ngawl natu in a keam sia upna ahi hi. Banghang ziam cile ama in, Israel te ii ngalvilte pawlvawt in zindo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Ka son tawto lai tu ziam? Gideon, Barak, Samson, Jephthah, David, Samuel le kamsaangte theampo ii thu ka son natu hun kicing ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Upna tungtawnin, amate in, ngam bu bup sim uh a, zo uh hi. Amate in a maan nasepte seam a, tuaciang Pathian kamciamte saang uh hi. Amate in tawpite kam humcip a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />a kiitakhuai meikuangte sumit in namsau taw thalup natu pan suakta uh hi. Amate sia thaneam kale thahatte suak uh hi; amate sia kidona sungah thahat a, ngamdangmi ngalkapte zothal uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Upna tungtawnin a thisa a kinungtasak kik a mealheakte, numeite in nga uh hi. A dangte ahile, suatakna a saan tu nial in, a phazaw nuntakna sungah a kithaw kiksak natu in, vawtsiat zazaan thuakin thi uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Pawlkhat sia kiselno in kivel a, pawlkhat sia thikkol kibulin, thong sungah kikhum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" />Amate suang taw kideang hi, tum nii sua in ki attan a, namsau taw kithat hi. Amate tuuvun ahibuale, kealvun silhin vak uh hi — zawngkhal in, kivawtsia a, ahi ngawl lalam in kivawt uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" />Leitung sia amate taw a kiphu bua hi! Amate in ngaltaite bangin, sennealngamsung le mual tungah vakthap in, suanghawng leihawng sungah a teang uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" />Upna a nei hu in hi mite theampo sia bangza in teptee huai ziam! Ahihang amate in, Pathian kamciam a saang man bua uh hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />banghang ziam cile Pathian in ei atu a phazaw tupna, hong neisak hi. Ama ii tupna sia, eite taw ih kitholkhop ciang bekin a kicialcingsak pheang tu ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ei ih hi le, ih kiimkot ah hiza a tam mihonpi tetti ih nei hi. Tua ahikom ih mai hong khak thei na theampo le hong lencip thei mawnate vawkin, ih mai ah tai kidemna sungah thin khensatsa in tai tek tawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A kipatna pan a tawp dong upna a piangsak pa, a kicingsakpa Jesus mitsuan tawng. Ama sia thinglamtee hangin thinkiam ngawl hi! Ama a ngak nginge lungdamna hangin, thinglamtee tungah maizum thina sia pha maw sa ngawl zaw a, tu in Pathian tokhum ziatsang ah to hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama thuakna teng ngaisun vun; bangza in mawneite ii a nasia tatak etsatna thuak ziam! Tua ahikom note zongh thinkiam heak vun, hanciam vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile mawna taw na kidona sungah thalup thuak tu dongin, na nalh tu uh kul ngawl lai buang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pathian in a tate na hina uh taw hanthotna kam hong paute mangil zo nu ziam? “Ka tapa awng, Topa ii hong hil ciangin, a pha takin ngai in, hong teih ciangin thinkiam heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile Topa in a itte theampo hil a, a ta bangin a saante theampo daan pia hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pa ii daan hong piak bang na thuak po vun; tua na thuakna in Pathian ii a tate bangin hong tuat a hina kiciansak hi. A pa ii daan a piak ngeingawl tapa a om ngei ziam?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A tate theampo a piak bangin daan hong pia ngei bua ahile, ta tatak hi ngawlin, lamlak ta na hi uh hunlam kilangh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ih leitung pate tungtaang ahile amate in daan hong pia a, eite zongh in zatakna ih pia hi. Tua ahile thaa lamsang ih Pa tungah bangza in ki aap zaw tu a, nungta zaw tu hi ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ih leitung pate in pha a sak uh ciaciang, tawmvei sung daan hong pia hi; ahihang Pathian in, ahile, ama thianthona ih siim thei natu in eima phattuam natu a vawt ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Eite daan hong kipiak ciangin, tua hun laitak ih lungdam natu hi ngawlin, ih hee natu hong pia hile kilawm hi. Ahihang nungsang ciangin, tuabang kitekna a thuakte in thumaan thutang nuntakna ii thinnopna thaman nga uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tua ahikom na khut uh a kha le laamto vun a, a huang vadil na khupte uh hatsak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na peang a bai na sang a dam zawk natu le a kizak thei kik natu in, lamzin tang zui tawntung tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mihing theampo taw na kilem tu hanciam vun a, a thiangtho nuntakna taw nuntak tu hanciam tavun, banghang ziam cile kuama in tua ngawl taw Topa a mu buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Pathian ii thuthiamna pan na heak kik ngawl natu kikeam tavun. A khaa thingkung khangto a, lalna tam mama a piangsak nguu a nei thingkung bang na hi heak vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Esau bangin paktatna ahibuale thaa lamsang zawngkhalna kuama in na nei heak vun, ama in ta uzaw ii a nga tu hamphatnate theampo anneak khat taw zuak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tua zawkciangin, na heak uh bangma, ama in a pa ii thupha saang nuam hi; ahihang ama kinolh hi, banghang ziam cile ama in ama ii a sep sate a kheal kik natu lampi sia thitui taak liangin a zon hang zong a mu thei bua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Note in Israel mite Sinai mual a zot uh bangin cii le sa ii phaw theinate ahi meikuang ahizong, khuazing le khuangial ahizong, vuipi suangval ahizong,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />lemle aw le awnging khat ahizong, tuate kung nong zuan bua uh hi. Israel mihingte in tua awnging khat a zaak uh ciangin, kammal dang a zaak ngawl natu in, thuum uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile amate in, “Nganhing khat ngawngawn in tua mual a thutha le suangtum taw hua lup kul tu hi,” ci in thupiakna sia a thuak zo bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tua a muna sia lauhuai leilam ahikom, Moses in “Lau in ka liing vadil hi!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Note Zion Mual le a nungta Pathian khuapi vantung Jerusalem, vantunglalang tul tam mamate omna ah nong pai zaw uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Note in vantung ah a min a kikhum Pathian taciilte lungdam takin a kikhopna ah nong pai uh hi. Note in mihing theampo thukhenpa Pathian kung le a kicialcingsak mihingphate ii thaa omna munah nong pai uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thuciam thak a vawtpa Jesus kungah nong pai uh a, Abel chi ii sep sangin a phazaw pek nate hong kamciam, a kithe chi kungah nong zuan uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua ahikomin kidawm vun a, a sonpa sia ngai nuam ngawlin, nial heak vun. Pathian thu leitung ah a son pa nadon ngawl a, a nialte a suakta bua hi. Vantung pan hong sonpa na thusim buale bangbang suakta thei seseam tu hi ziam!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama aw in tua hun laitakin, leitung liingsak ahihang tu in ama in, “Leitung bek hi ngawlin, vantung zongh khatvei ma ka liingsak lai tu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hi kammal “khatvei ma” ci sia in bitphua sa nate ngawk zazaanin, khiin tu a, a kingawksak thei ngawl teng bek taang lai tu a hina thiang takin lak hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ahiciang, lungdam tek tawng, banghang ziam cile eite in, a kingawk thei ngawl ngam ih nga hi. Ama lungkim tu bangin, eite in thasiana le kiitakna taw Pathian tungah lungdamko in, ama bia tek tawng;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />banghang ziam cile ih Pathian sia a haltum thei meikuang tatak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tapidaw mi unau khat bangin khat le khat ki it tawntung vun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na inn ah leangnate zin na do tu mangil heak vun. Tuabang a ngamta pawlkhat in vantunglalangte zin dawdo ahi hunlam a he bua uh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thongsung a omte na phawk tavun a, noma zongh amate taw thongtaak khawm bangin kingaisun tavun. Ngim a thuakte na phawk tavun a, noma zongh amate taw ngim a thuak khawm bangin na kingaisun tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nupa kiteenna sia a kuama theampo in zatak vawt tahen a, pasalte le zite sia khat le khat tungah kithumaan hamtang tahen. Pathian in a paktatte le a kipalngulte tungah thukhen tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na nuntakna uh sia sum le vanh manpha deina taw na kipealsak vun a, tuaciangin na nei uh sia taw na lungkim vun. Banghang ziam cile Pathian in, “Bangma hunin kong taisan ngei buatu a, kong nusia ngei buatu hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tua ahikom hangsan takin, hi bangin ci tawng, “Topa sia kei hong hu pa hi a, ka pa tau buatu hi. Akua in kei bang hong law thei tu ziam?”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />No tungah Pathian thu hong son na lampui masate phawk vun. Amate bangbangin nungta a, bangbangin thi ziam ci in ngaisunin, amate upna bang na ettee tavun.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jesus Christ sia zeini, tuni le a tawntungin a kibang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A lam dadang kihilna nam tuatuamte zui in, thumaan lampi pan pial heak vun. Neak le dawn vai thukhamte zuina taw hi ngawlin, Pathian ii thuthiamna pan, ih sungsang thahatna nga tu sia pha hi; neak le dawn lamsang thukham zuite tungah tua thukhamte in phattuamna pia ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Jew te ii biakna munah thiampi seamte in, ih biaknatau tungah a om sate a neak thei natu thu nga ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Jew te ii Thiampi Lianbelpa in ngannote ii chi sia Thiangthobel Mun ah mawphel biakpiak natu in tumpui hi; ahihang ngannote ii pum sia ngiaphual puasia ah hal hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hi thu hu in, Jesus zongh mihingte mawna pan a chisan taw a thiansua natu in, khuapi puasang ah thi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua ahikom, eite zongh ngiaphual puasang, ama kung zuanin a maizumnate thuak pui tawng.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Banghang ziam cile hi leitung ah a kip khuapi khat zongh ih nei bua hi; eite in hong piang pheang tu khuapi sia ih zon laitak ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua ahikom, eite in Jesus tungtawnin ih kipum piak biakpiakna in Pathian pok tawntung tawng, Topa hi ci in a pualaakte ii kam taw a kipia biakpiakna in tuasia ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na pha sep tu le khat le khat kihu tu sia, na mangil heak vun, banghang ziam cile hite sia Pathian a lungkimsak ih kipumpiak biakpiakna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na lampuite ii thupiakna na zui vun. Amate ii thu na ni vun. Amate in tawlnga ngawlin na thaa uh hong cinsak hi, banghang ziam cile amate in, Pathian tungah amate nasep huvau sazian a lak kul tu hi. Amate thu na ni uh le amate sia lungdam takin, naseam tu hi; tua hi buathong le, amate in heena taw naseam tu a, note atu in bangma phattuamna a om buatu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ko atu thu hong ngetsak tawntung tavun. Thin thiangtho nei ung, ci ngam khu hi, banghang ziam cile, a maan bekma seam tawntung nuam khu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Note kungah hai ngawlin, Pathian ii kei hong paisak kik pal natu thu nong ngetsak thua lai tu uh nasia tak kong thum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A nuntakna biakpiakna in a piak hu in Tuucing Lian ahi Topa Jesus sia Pathian in thina pan tho kiksak zo a, tuaciang a chisan hu in a tawntung thuciamna sia kikipsak zo hi. Kilemna Pathian in ama ii dei sia na vawt thei natu in na kisap uh vanh pha theampo hong pia tahen a, tuaciang ama diksak sia Jesus Christ tungtawnin ei sungah hong seam tahen. Christ tungah minthanna a tawntung a tawntungin om tahen! Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Suapuite awng, hi kihanthotna kammalte pha takin na ngai vun ci in kong thum hi; banghang ziam cile hi laithak kong at sia sau leih ngawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Ih suapui Timothy sia thongsung panin kipusuaksak zo hi, ci sia kong zasak nuam hi. Hong theng pal nale, noma taw kimu tu in, kong tonpui tu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Pathian mite theampo le na lampuite theampo tungah kong nuksetna kam na zasak vun. Italy pan suapuite in hong nukset hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Pathian ii thuthiamna sia note theampo taw om tahen.
  </para>
</usx>
